@format 1
@id queue.create-split-work
@title Create split work
@area Queue
@entry input
@summary Convert visible Split sections into one pending work item per enabled valid section.
@flow TB
@related queue.add-work, processing.start
@tag queue
@tag create-split-work

@alias splitUi = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LSplit
@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule
@alias split = Cadroue.Application.LSplit

[input] Queue command <input>
- Receive a queue request and capture its priority, sources, output preset, tab, and relay routing @ splitUi.LSplitDescribe(...)
> build

[build] Build work descriptions <decision>
- Build a split description from the active media, sections, and output preset @ splitUi.LSplitDescribe(...)
- Reject a missing source or empty section set @ split.LSplitItemsCreate(...)
- Skip hidden and invalid ranges while preserving section numbering @ split.LSplitItemsCreate(...)
- Create unique output names and split work items @ split.LSplitItemsCreate(...)
? "One or more valid work items are built" > persist
? "No valid work item can be built" > rejected

[persist] Add work to schedule <storage>
- Assign relay routing and lineage and persist every work record @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
> result

[result] Work queued <output>
= Successfully persisted work appears as pending in the shared worklist.

[rejected] Queue request rejected <error>
= No work record is added.
